Name:Thief
Desc:The Thief only wakes up on the first night. They must steal the role of another player, whose abilities they gain, and the cards will be switched around. For the rest of the game, the new Thief acts as a normal Citizen. The new Thief should be made aware their role has changed (see Page 28).
